{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266d3EuyGM661795561988.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國人工智能公司Anthropic，上市第四日就跌穿招股價，收市價81.91美元，較上市價83美元低百分之1.3，較6月上市的SpaceX上市21日才跌穿招股價來得更快，有交易員更預期，Anthropic的跌勢未完。</p><p></p><p>據財經頻道CNBC報道，Anthropic的期權交易正在增加，截至美國時間星期二中午，已有近50萬張權期成交，總期權金約2.5億美元，成為市場上第六大活躍期權交易。當中最大一宗交易，是買入11,000張行使價75美元，下月中到期的認沽期權，金額750萬美元。</p><p></p><p>不過，亦有投資銀行看好Anthropic，加拿大投資銀行Canaccord Genuity剛給予Anthropic「買入」評級，目標價135美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:44:21.919001+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T17:17:34.763672+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:37:37.990756+00:00","content_hash":"25a685db3c251cd2f20ce92bc5c10c9caa40b4feb267849528cd2e94f9ba27ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:44:21.919001+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}